--[[ SCP-096 (FE) | The Chosen One   (mech v3 FE method)   -   20 BRICK LIMIT
  Brick (image 3): thin tall pillar, 1 stud footprint, long side L (looks ~1x2.5x1 / 1x3x1 - the script measures it).
  Everything is sized from L ("u" = L x size slider):  standing height = 5.55 u   (L = 3 -> ~16.7 studs)

  BRICK BUDGET (exactly 20):
    head 1 | jaw 1 | torso 2 | arms 2+2 (upper + fore) | legs 2+2 (thigh + shin) | fingers 4+4  = 20
    legs  : thigh 1.35u + shin 1.35u   (hip height 2.6u)         torso: 2 bricks spaced 0.6u = 1.6u tall
    arms  : upper 1.45u + fore 1.45u + fingers 0.8u -> hands hang by the knees like the picture
    head  : 1 tall brick (long skull) + 1 brick jaw that swings open for the scream
  With fewer than 20 bricks the fingers shrink (minimum 14 bricks = 1 finger per hand).

  CALM  : sitting on the ground, knees up, torso curled, head down, one hand covering the face (image 1)
  ANGER : arms the trap. TAP A PLAYER (or "Target nearest"):
          stands up -> shakes head + body -> SCREAMS -> runs at 23 studs/sec -> stops next to the target
          and reaches for him (it never runs through anyone).  Calm = back to sitting.
  BRING SCP : teleports him in front of you.   NOCLIP : walk through walls / respect walls.
  FE : unanchored + un-welded bricks you own; anti-gravity; while raging your avatar rides inside him
       (so the bricks keep belonging to you). Colors are LOCAL ONLY.
]]

